        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we operate three bonded warehouses under the OMA Carga brand that provide cargo logistics services, which include storage, handling, custody maneuvers, loading and unloading, and x-ray screening of exports, among other services.",
        "start_character": 32232,
        "end_character": 32474
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-051987",
