        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-051987",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we were party to approximately 1,269 contracts with providers of commercial services in the commercial space in our airports, including retail store operators, duty free store operators, food and beverage providers, financial services providers, car rental companies, telecommunications providers, VIP lounges, advertising, travel agencies, time-share sales and promotions services and tourist information and promotion services.",
        "start_character": 133835,
        "end_character": 134289
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-051987",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-051987-546cca4fbda3dcf5",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-051987",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "At each of our airports, we earn revenues from charging access and other fees from third-party providers, ramp-handling and baggage-handling services, catering services, aircraft security, providers of aircraft maintenance and repair and fuel.",
        "start_character": 49593,
        "end_character": 49836
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-051987",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-051987-546cca4fbda3dcf5",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-051987",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If any service providers were to halt operations at any of our airports, we could be required to seek a new provider of these services or to provide these services ourselves.",
        "start_character": 50339,
        "end_character": 50513
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-051987",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-051987-546cca4fbda3dcf5",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-051987",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we lease spaces to third-party tenants that provide commercial services such as food and beverage, retail and advertising.",
        "start_character": 181177,
        "end_character": 181312
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-051987",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-051987-546cca4fbda3dcf5",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-051987",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Under the Mexican Airport Law, we are required to provide complementary services at each of our airports if there is no third party providing such services.",
        "start_character": 50182,
        "end_character": 50338
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-051987",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-051987-546cca4fbda3dcf5",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-051987",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We currently maintain contracts with 45 companies that provide the majority of these complementary services at our 13 airports.",
        "start_character": 50054,
        "end_character": 50181
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-051987",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-051987-546cca4fbda3dcf5",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-051987",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have also encouraged our car rental providers to differentiate their VIP services and modernize their facilities.",
        "start_character": 60341,
        "end_character": 60457
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-051987",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-051987-546cca4fbda3dcf5",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-051987",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We lease space to financial services providers (such as currency exchange bureaus, banks and ATMs) at our airports, and we charge providers of these financial services fees based partly on a percentage of the revenues recorded by their operations.",
        "start_character": 60729,
        "end_character": 60976
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-051987",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-051987-546cca4fbda3dcf5",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-051987",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer telephone, mobile phone and internet services at our airports through contractual agreements with service providers and offer wireless internet access at all of our airports.",
        "start_character": 61062,
